msgctxt "L_DEPO_071"
msgid "CamSpy has been destroyed - abort mission.\\n"
msgstr "CamSpy has been destroyed - abort mission.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_072"
msgid ""
"We've recovered the sapient from Carrington \\nand altered its programming. "
"It no longer \\nhas a personality, so there will be no \\nfurther "
"incidents.\\n"
msgstr ""
"We've recovered the sapient from Carrington \\nand altered its programming. "
"It no longer \\nhas a personality, so there will be no \\nfurther "
"incidents.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_073"
msgid ""
"This will reduce its efficiency. My team will \\nhave to take it to the core"
" themselves. This \\nwill endanger them. You should have \\nanticipated that"
" the sapient might develop \\na troublesome moral code.\\n"
msgstr ""
"This will reduce its efficiency. My team will \\nhave to take it to the core"
" themselves. This \\nwill endanger them. You should have \\nanticipated that"
" the sapient might develop \\na troublesome moral code.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_074"
msgid ""
"No one could have predicted that! And I \\nresent being singled out for "
"blame! \\nWhat about him?\\n"
msgstr ""
"No one could have predicted that! And I \\nresent being singled out for "
"blame! \\nWhat about him?\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_075"
msgid ""
"The President turned down your request for \\nthe loan of the Pelagic II?\\n"
msgstr ""
"The President turned down your request for \\nthe loan of the Pelagic II?\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_076"
msgid "Could it be you overestimated your \\ninfluence over him?\\n"
msgstr "Could it be you overestimated your \\ninfluence over him?\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_077"
msgid ""
"No! Perhaps I underestimated his resolve. \\nWe have a contingency plan "
"ready to go, \\nand we will move as soon as the Presidential \\nentourage "
"arrives at the air base. All I \\nneed from the President is a tissue "
"sample.\\n"
msgstr ""
"No! Perhaps I underestimated his resolve. \\nWe have a contingency plan "
"ready to go, \\nand we will move as soon as the Presidential \\nentourage "
"arrives at the air base. All I \\nneed from the President is a tissue "
"sample.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_078"
msgid ""
"Ha! Assuming you don't get any interference. \\nIf Carrington has pieced "
"together enough of \\nthis, he will have called for reinforcements.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Ha! Assuming you don't get any interference. \\nIf Carrington has pieced "
"together enough of \\nthis, he will have called for reinforcements.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_079"
msgid ""
"There will be no outside help for \\nMr. Carrington. The technology you gave"
" us \\nis installed in Nevada and fully operational. \\nWe can intercept any"
" craft they use.\\n"
msgstr ""
"There will be no outside help for \\nMr. Carrington. The technology you gave"
" us \\nis installed in Nevada and fully operational. \\nWe can intercept any"
" craft they use.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_080"
msgid ""
"Then the devices we gave you are working \\ncorrectly? Good. Because we "
"believe \\nanything which does not work correctly \\nshould be destroyed. "
"Consider that as you \\nfollow your 'backup plans.'\\n"
msgstr ""
"Then the devices we gave you are working \\ncorrectly? Good. Because we "
"believe \\nanything which does not work correctly \\nshould be destroyed. "
"Consider that as you \\nfollow your 'backup plans.'\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_081"
msgid ""
"Agent Dark reporting in! Prepare to \\nreceive a download of the meeting "
"data. \\nPriority request for an Institute Support \\nTeam to protect the "
"President before he \\ngoes to Alaska.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Agent Dark reporting in! Prepare to \\nreceive a download of the meeting "
"data. \\nPriority request for an Institute Support \\nTeam to protect the "
"President before he \\ngoes to Alaska.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_082"
msgid ""
"No time for that now, Agent Dark. There's \\nbeen a development during radio"
" silence. \\nThe craft carrying those 'friends' I was \\ntalking about was "
"shot down over Nevada. \\nThe weapon responsible was fired from \\nArea "
"51... that's where the survivors and \\ndebris will have been taken. You're "
"to \\nprep for immediate dispatch when you \\nreturn here. Carrington "
"out.\\n"
msgstr ""
"No time for that now, Agent Dark. There's \\nbeen a development during radio"
" silence. \\nThe craft carrying those 'friends' I was \\ntalking about was "
"shot down over Nevada. \\nThe weapon responsible was fired from \\nArea "
"51... that's where the survivors and \\ndebris will have been taken. You're "
"to \\nprep for immediate dispatch when you \\nreturn here. Carrington "
"out.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_083"
msgid "Area 51? But what about the President?\\n"
msgstr "Area 51? But what about the President?\\n"
